","content":"<pre class=sf-dump id=sf-dump-515845702 data-indent-pad=\"  \"><span class=sf-dump-note>array:43</span> [<samp data-depth=1 class=sf-dump-expanded>
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Noemie_Valerio</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"497 characters\">I hold a Master&#8217;s degree in Modern Letters and a Master&#8217;s degree in Classical Letters, and pursued a bilingual curriculum in French and English. <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"497 characters\">&lt;br/&gt;I have taught French, FLE and FLS in different schools.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"497 characters\">&lt;br/&gt;Since 2018, I am a trainer and a teacher at the Greta (Education for Adults) in Nancy. I work for the French Office for Immigration and Integration (OFII) in the FLE, and also teach literature in high school.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"497 characters\">&lt;br/&gt;I have been participating in the Cours d&#8217;Et&#233; in Nancy since 2017. <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Helene_Lauria</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"558 characters\">Previously actress, I studied acting, writing and staging at the Higher School of Dramatic Art in Paris (ESAD-Paris). I also have a master&#039;s degree in Journalism from the Higher School of Journalism (ESJ-Paris) and a Master 2 in Theater Studies at La Sorbonne Nouvelle University) and I am specialized in theatrical creation in conflict zones and /or war. I work as a professor of French mainly abroad in Alliances fran&#231;aises or Instituts fran&#231;ais (Israel, Czech Republic or Poland). I am the holder of the DAEFLE and am certified assessor for DELF and DALF.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Anne_Ce&#769;cile_Guillot</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"232 characters\">Titulaire d&#8217;une mai&#770;trise en Franc&#807;ais Langue Etrange&#768;re, j&#8217;enseigne au sein de diffe&#769;rentes structures universitaires (Science-Po, ICN Business School) et en entreprise. J&#8217;interviens au Cours d&#8217;e&#769;te&#769; de Nancy depuis plus de 15 ans.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Patricia_Faustinelli</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"418 characters\">With a BA in Art History and an MA in French as a Foreign Language (FFL), I am a teacher of French accredited with the French Ministry of Education. I teach highschool since 1991 and coordinate a programme of French for non-francophones in my school. Since 1987 I have taught FFL in university settings in France and Britain (SIEE/Universit&#233; de Lorraine; UMIST/Manchester). I have taught at the Cours d&#039;&#233;t&#233; since 1991.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Nicole_Fontanez</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"198 characters\">I am a senior teacher accredited with the French Ministry of Education in French, and Arts (theater). I am also a certified assessor for DELF and DALF. I have taught for 10 years at the Cours d&#039;&#201;t&#233;.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Nathalie_Guiganti</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"772 characters\">I hold a masters in language sciences and teaching of languages and have taught French as a foreign language since 1993 in secondary schools (overseeing French language programs and as a certified DELF tester) as well as in private firms and with the Universit&#233; de Lorraine (CRAPEL-ATILF-DEFLE). I am in charge of the educational seminar of the Summer Courses. Since 1995, I have trained teacher candidates preparing for the CAPES in the area of foreign language pedagogy. I have been participating in the Cours d&#8217;Et&#233; in Nancy since 1995. &lt;br&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"772 characters\">I have also worked abroad in a number of universities, in Spain, Mexico and Morocco. I am currently teaching Spanish and have authored the book : Trait d&#8217;Union 2 (French for non-native speakers), Cl&#233; International, January 2005.</span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Liliane_Magnien</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"287 characters\">I hold both a doctorate in French language and literature as well as a masters in philosophy. I have taught literature and philosophy at the secondary level and am now teaching at the Universit&#233; de la Culture permanente. I have been participating in the Cours d&#8217;Et&#233; in Nancy since 2013. </span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Catherine_Pelletier</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"565 characters\">I hold a Master&#039;s degree in Germanic, Scandinavian and Slavic literatures and civilizations. I have written a number of articles in the area of ethnolinguistic studies of human and especially national stereotypes.&lt;br&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"565 characters\">I taught French as a foreign language for 18 years in a number of different settings abroad. I held teaching positions in universities, private industry and in associations in France, Switerland, Luxembourg and in Brazil.&lt;br&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"565 characters\">I am a speaker of English, Polish and Portuguese.&lt;br&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"565 characters\">I have been a member of the team of the&amp;nbsp;Cours&amp;nbsp;since 2003.</span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Philippe_Bruant</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">I hold a doctorate in Geography and am a passionate teacher, lecturer and guide of my city, Nancy. I spent my entire childhood and my teen years on Place Stanislas. In addition to all of that, I am a tour group leader for forts located around Toul as well as for a number of major battlefields of the First World War. I have also written a number of books about that conflict.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">   &lt;br&gt;Last publication : &lt;i style=&quot;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;La Bataille du Grand Couronn&#233;&lt;/i&gt;, Editions G&#233;rard-Louis, 2014, and &lt;i style=&quot;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;Mes guerres en culottes courtes Place Stanislas&lt;/i&gt;, Editions Gerard Louis, 2018. <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"680 characters\">I have been participating in the Cours d&#8217;Et&#233; in Nancy since 1998. </span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Benoi&#770;t_He&#769;rique</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1153 characters\">Born and raised in Nancy, Dr. Ben H&#233;rique has been a French teacher at Ashbury College, an independent school in Ottawa, since 1984. Prior to that, he was a physical Education teacher for three years at Saint Michaels university School in Victoria, B.C. He also taught in the United States, Switzerland and France. Besides teaching and since 1973, he has organized and led led sixty European Tours during his school holidays, principally for the French Ministry Education and Ashbury College.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1153 characters\">&lt;br&gt;He holds a Doctorate in French literature and civilization from the Sorbonne, has a Master&#039;s in French as a modern language and a MA in English, and Bachelor&#039;s degrees in French as a Foreign language, French Linguistics, and English from Universit&#233; de Lorraine. He is certified to teach French and ESL in Ontario and Quebec. He was a swimming instructor/coach and a rugby coach/referee both in France and Canada. In 2010, Dr. H&#233;rique was awarded one of France&#8217;s prestigious academic awards, &quot;Chevalier dans l&#8217;Ordre des Palmes Acad&#233;miques&quot;, by the Government of France for his teaching and promotion of French culture through education.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1153 characters\">                    </span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Emmanuel_He&#769;rique</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1090 characters\">A native from Nancy, Dr. Emmanuel H&#233;rique is a professor of French language and linguistics at the University of Victoria, Canada since 1982. He holds a Doctorate in French and General Linguistics, Master&#039;s and Bachelor&#039;s degrees in French as a Modern Language, Linguistics, and English, plus a BA equivalency in Arabic, all from Universit&#233; de Nancy II, France (now Universit&#233; de Lorraine). Since 1985, he has co-led most of the &quot;Tour de France&quot; and &quot;French Summer Schools in Paris&quot; educational trips for Ashbury College, an independent school in Ottawa, Canada.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1090 characters\">&lt;br&gt;Emmanuel is also an accredited Conference Interpreter for the Canadian Federal Government, and a Certified Translator. His working languages are French and English. He also studied Japanese language and culture at the University of Victoria, followed by a 10-month stay in Osaka, Japan, where he returns frequently. He received fellowships from Bourguiba Institute in Tunis, Canada Research Council, and the Japan Foundation. He is certified to teach English in the French School System, and enjoys the practice of aikido.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Gilles_Losseroy</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1403 characters\">Director of the Cours d&#039;&#201;t&#233; : I hold a doctorate in French language, literature and culture, and a certificate in Educational Media-FFL (CAREL, Royan). I teach Performance Studies at Universit&#233; de Lorraine and direct a theatre company called &lt;a href=&#039;https://www.lamazurkadusangnoir.com/&#039;&gt;La Mazurka du Sang Noir&lt;/a&gt;. I run theatre workshops for highschools and universities around the world, eg Russia, Brazil, Indonesia, Germany. I have designed an integrative approach using theatre in the teaching of French, and put it in practice each year in the theatre workshop of the Cours d&#039;&#233;t&#233;. I started teaching French grammar and literature in the Cours d&#039;&#233;t&#233; in 1988.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1403 characters\">&lt;br&gt;Publications:<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1403 characters\">&lt;br&gt;- Literary studies: see  &lt;a href=&quot;http://lis.univ-lorraine.fr/membres/titulaires/losseroy-gilles&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; &gt;http://lis.univ-lorraine.fr/membres/titulaires/losseroy-gilles&lt;/a&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1403 characters\">&lt;br&gt;- Cultural and FFL studies:<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1403 characters\">&lt;br&gt;&quot;Un &#233;t&#233; &#224; Nancy : la didactique sur les planches&quot; in &lt;i style=&quot;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;Le Fran&#231;ais dans le monde&lt;/i&gt;, 237, Nov.-Dec. &#039;90.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1403 characters\">&lt;br&gt;&quot;La Fontaine sur sc&#232;ne&quot; in i &lt;i style=&quot;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;Le Fran&#231;ais dans le monde&lt;/i&gt;, 273, May-June &#039;95.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1403 characters\">&lt;br&gt;&quot;Th&#233;&#226;tre en A.P.P.&#160;[Atelier de P&#233;dagogie Personnalis&#233;e]&quot; in i &lt;i style=&quot;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;La Formation se met en sc&#232;ne&lt;/i&gt;, Centre Info, 1996.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1403 characters\">&lt;br&gt;&quot;Le Cin&#233;ma en Indon&#233;sie&quot; in &lt;i style=&quot;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;La Revue du cin&#233;ma&lt;/i&gt;, 433, Dec. &#039;87.</span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Michel_Manel</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"442 characters\">With an MA in Geography I am a teacher accredited with the French Ministry of Education, and a musician. I teach highschool and also assess and mentor young colleagues who want to enter the profession. I graduated from the Conservatory of Music in Theory, Solfege, and Euphonium, and currently play euphonium solo in the Band of the city of Metz. I have taught  Civilization, and French media and press at the Cours d&#039;&#201;t&#233; in Nancy since 1995.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Charles_McCreary</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"416 characters\">I have been a professor of French (language, literature and culture) at Indiana University of Pennsylvania for nearly 30 years. My areas of interest include French literature of the 17th, 18th and 19th centuries. I have been accompanying American students to the Cours d&#8217;Et&#233; in Nancy since 1989 and am now teaching the translation course. The City of Nancy rewarded my fidelity in 2019 by giving me its Golden Medal.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|S&#233;bastien_Pabst</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"875 characters\">Holding a Master&#8217;s degree in &#171; Language Sciences and Language Teaching, specialized in French as a Foreign Languages (FLE) &#187;, a Bachelor&#8217;s degree in &#171; English Language and Literature &#187; and a Bachelor&#8217;s degree in &#171; Applied Foreign Languages &#187;, I have been teaching French as a Foreign Language, English and Interculturality for ten years in several Universities and Colleges (ICN Business School, EI.Cesi, Exia.Cesi, Sciences-Po, Luxembourg School for Commerce&#8230;) and I am a jury member for Master and Bachelor Programs competitive entrance admissions. I also teach abroad in Universities and business settings (UK, Luxembourg, Belgium, Morocco, Latvia&#8230;) and  I am the program director of a language-training center. Besides my teaching activities, I sing in a music band performing around the world : &lt;a href=&quot;http://pobox-band.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;http://pobox-band.com/&lt;/a&gt;</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>pedagogical_team|Fabrice_Sand</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"952 characters\">I hold a Master&#8217;s degree in French as a Foreign Language didactics, and a Bachelor-level degree in Italian Language, Literature and Civilization. I started working for the Cours d&#8217;Et&#233; in Nancy in 2000  before living abroad and teaching French as a foreign language in places such as the Alliance Fran&#231;aise in Monterrey, the Centro Universitario de la Costa de Puerto Vallarta, Mexico, University of Aberdeen, Scotland, UK, or the Institut fran&#231;ais in Barcelona and the Escola de Idiomes Moderns de l&#8217;Universitat de Barcelona, Spain&#8230;  Then and since 2013, I pursued my activity in France as a teacher for foreign students at ICN Business School in Nancy. <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"952 characters\">&lt;br/&gt;I&#8217;m back at the Cours d&#8217;Et&#233; since 2018 and also teach French as a foreign language and &#171; Fran&#231;ais Langue Seconde &#187; (FLS) in the framework of a didactic unity for allophone students in public schools. I have an accreditation for DELF DALF exams. I am fluent in English, Italian and Spanish.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|title</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"24 characters\">COMPOSITION OF THE BOARD</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|subTitle1</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"10 characters\">COMMITTEE:</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p1</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"251 characters\">Our association &lt;em&gt;Cours d&#8217;&#201;t&#233; pour &#201;tudiants &#201;trangers&lt;/em&gt; is made up of 18 active members, 13 of whom are professors of the Universit&#233; de Lorraine. Our Board of Directors and current president, are responsible for putting our programs into place.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p2</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"130 characters\">President : Dr Fran&#231;oise VIRY-BABEL, Medical Doctor at the Nancy University Hospital (Centre Hospitalier Universitaire de Nancy)  </span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p3</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"124 characters\">Secretary : Dr Laurence KOHN-PIREAUX, Senior Lecturer in Comparative and General Literature at the Universit&#233; de Lorraine.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"124 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p4</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"95 characters\">Treasurer : Ms Lorraine CHAUMONT, Administrative Assistant at the ICN Business School in Nancy.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p5</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"111 characters\">Assistant Treasurer : Dr Fran&#231;oise VIRY-BABEL, Medical Doctor at the Centre Hospitalier Universitaire de Nancy.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|subTitle2</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"24 characters\">MEMBERS OF THE COUNCIL :</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p6</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"108 characters\">Dr Lucie KEMPF, Senior Lecturer at the Universit&#233; de Lorraine, director of the LLCER Russian degree program.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p7</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"96 characters\">Dr Philippe BRUANT, Doctorate in Geography from the Universit&#233; de Nancy, historian and lecturer.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p8</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"81 characters\">Pr Patrick CORBET, Professor of Medieval History at the Universit&#233; de Lorraine.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"81 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p9</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"77 characters\">Dr Alain LITAIZE, Lexicologist , specialist in Lorraine-Roman dialectology.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"77 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>summercourse|title</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"12 characters\">OUR IDENTITY</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>summercourse|p1</span>\" => \"\"\"
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"90 characters\">Three great reasons to choose the &lt;em&gt;Cours d&#039;&#201;t&#233; Pour &#201;tudiants &#201;trangers&lt;/em&gt; de Nancy<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"90 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
    \"\"\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>summercourse|p1_1</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"112 characters\">&lt;span class=&#039;s1&#039;&gt;1:&lt;span class=&#039;s2&#039; style=&#039;font-size:15px;&#039;&gt; The INTENSIVE&lt;/span&gt;nature of our program :&lt;/span&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>summercourse|p1_2</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"158 characters\">20 hours of academic courses per week (mornings) and 1 hour 30 of themed language workshops per week (3 to 5 afternoons depending on the program of the week) </span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>summercourse|p2</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"89 characters\">&lt;span class=&#039;s3&#039;&gt;2: &lt;span class=&#039;s1&#039;&gt;the wide variety of our CULTURAL ACTIVITIES:&lt;/span&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>summercourse|p2_1</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"449 characters\">Field trips, social events, cultural visits, lectures and two 3-day trips. One of these weekend trips is to Paris, and the other is to one of the best known centers of French culture. In the past few years, we have visited: Mont-Blanc and its sea of ice, Marseille and the festival of Avignon, Mont Saint-Michel, Nice and the Riviera, the D-Day Beaches in Normandy, Reims and its cathedral, Champagne region with its vineyards... and Arthur Rimbaud.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>summercourse|p3</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"105 characters\">&lt;span class=&#039;s3&#039;&gt;3: &lt;/span&gt; Our&lt;span class=&#039;s2&#039;&gt; &quot;ALL-INCLUDED&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#039;s1&#039;&gt; packages :&lt;/span&gt;</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>summercourse|p3_1</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"110 characters\">Courses, private rooms, meals, cultural activities, field trips: everything is included with no hidden costs. </span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>summercourse|p3_2</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"79 characters\">Les Cours d&#039;&#201;t&#233; Pour &#201;tudiants &#201;trangers de Nancy : a unique bargain in France!</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>presse|title</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"51 characters\">Les Cours d&amp;rsquo;Et&amp;eacute; dans les m&amp;eacute;dias</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>presse|p1</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"106 characters\">&lt;a href=&#039;{url1}&#039; class=&#039;bluelink&#039; target=&#039;newpage01&#039;&gt;Les &amp;eacute;tudiants font de la radio - RCN 2014 &lt;/a&gt;</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>presse|p2</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"65 characters\">&lt;a href=&#039;{url1}&#039; class=&#039;bluelink&#039; target=&#039;newpage01&#039;&gt;RCN 2015&lt;/a&gt;</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>presse|p3</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"40 characters\">La presse &amp;eacute;crite r&amp;eacute;gionale</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p10</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"90 characters\">Pr Alain GUYOT, Professor of 19th century French Literature at the Universit&#233; de Lorraine.</span>\"
  \"<span class=sf-dump-key>administration_team|p11</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"123 characters\">Pr Jean-Pierre HUSSON, Professor of Geography at the Universit&#233; de Lorraine, titular member of the &#8220;Acad&#233;mie de Stanislas&#8221;.</span>\"
</samp>]
</pre><script>Sfdump(\"sf-dump-515845702\", {\"maxDepth\":3,\"maxStringLength\":160})</script>
","team":"<pre class=sf-dump id=sf-dump-1767661675 data-indent-pad=\"  \"><span class=sf-dump-note>array:9</span> [<samp data-depth=1 class=sf-dump-expanded>
  <span class=sf-dump-index>0</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:5</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>lastname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8 characters\">Guiganti</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>firstname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"8 characters\">Nathalie</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>position</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"9 characters\">Professor</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>aboutit</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"34 characters\">pedagogical_team|Nathalie_Guiganti</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>picture</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"31 characters\">/img/team/Nathalie_Guiganti.png</span>\"
