  </samp>]
  <span class=sf-dump-index>2</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:8</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>3</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>firstname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4 characters\">Iwan</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>lastname</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>picture</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"25 characters\">/images/testimonies/3.png</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>deposit</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"104 characters\">C&#039;est le cours d&#039;?t? le plus merveilleux. On a des exp?riences ? partager. De plus tout est bien organis</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>occupation</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"20 characters\">professeur ? Jakarta</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>country</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"9 characters\">Indon?sie</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>promo</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4 characters\">2018</span>\"
  </samp>]
  <span class=sf-dump-index>3</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:8</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>4</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>firstname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"5 characters\">Irina</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>lastname</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>picture</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"25 characters\">/images/testimonies/4.png</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>deposit</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"324 characters\">Je vous remercie TOUS de tout mon c?ur : Gilles, les professeurs et TOUTE l&#039;?quipe du Cours d&#039;?t?, pour ces ?motions, pour ces nombreuses et belles &lt;br&gt;d?couvertes (au niveau de la langue aussi bien qu&#039;au niveau des ?v?nements et des visites), pour votre ?coute, pour votre amour, pour vous tout &lt;br&gt;simplement !<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"324 characters\">&lt;br&gt;MERCI !</span>
      \"\"\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>occupation</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"20 characters\">professeure ? Moscou</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>country</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6 characters\">Russie</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>promo</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4 characters\">2018</span>\"
  </samp>]
  <span class=sf-dump-index>4</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:8</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>5</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>firstname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6 characters\">Adelya</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>lastname</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>picture</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"25 characters\">/images/testimonies/5.png</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>deposit</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"53 characters\">Nancy me manque bcp &lt;span style=&quot;color:red;&quot;&gt;?&lt;/span&gt;</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>occupation</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"20 characters\"> ?tudiante ? Bandung</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>country</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"9 characters\">Indon?sie</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>promo</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4 characters\">2015</span>\"
  </samp>]
  <span class=sf-dump-index>5</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:8</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>6</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>firstname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"5 characters\">Karol</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>lastname</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>picture</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"25 characters\">/images/testimonies/6.png</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>deposit</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1350 characters\">Gr?ce ? la gentillesse de l?Alliance Fran?aise de Lublin et du Directeur des Cours d??t?, Monsieur Gilles Losseroy, j?ai eu occasion de joindre les loisirs ? l?apprentissage dans le cadre des cours d??t? de fran?ais de Nancy o? j?ai pass? 3 semaines. Positionn? dans un groupe avanc?, j?ai eu le privil?ge de choisir des cours qui convenaient d&#039;une fa?on plus proche ? mes int?r?ts. Quotidiennement j?ai assist? aux cours de la litt?rature, presse et civilisation, et techniques de l??crit et de l?oral. Le contact continu avec le fran?ais vivant m?a permis de m?habituer ? cette langue dans les situations quotidiennes et aussi de me pr?parer ? commencer des ?tudes sup?rieures focalis?es sur le fran?ais. L?environnement international dans lequel j?ai baign? pendant mon s?jour m?a permis de faire connaissance avec d?autres cultures. &lt;br&gt;J?ai bien profit? ?galement des excursions organis?es les week-ends. J?ai pu visiter<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r</span>par exemple l?incroyablement mignon Saint-Malo, Giverny o? Claude Monet - l?impressionniste c?l?bre - a cr?? et est mort, Strasbourg, et le point culminant de mon aventure que fut le week-end ? Paris. De plus, d?autres animations avaient ?t? pr?vues pour nous comme le cin?ma une fois par semaine, des banquets, des r?ceptions. J?en garde toujours les meilleurs souvenirs dans ma m?moire. C??tait une exp?rience inoubliable.</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>occupation</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17 characters\">?tudiant ? Lublin</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>country</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7 characters\">Pologne</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>promo</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4 characters\">2016</span>\"
  </samp>]
  <span class=sf-dump-index>6</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:8</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>7</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>firstname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"6 characters\">Monica</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>lastname</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>picture</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"25 characters\">/images/testimonies/7.png</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>deposit</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"234 characters\"> Couldn&#039;t have asked for a better French summer programme &amp; first time to Europe on my  own. Met some great people, saw amazing places &amp; had the pleasure of learning French from the best teachers!!<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"234 characters\">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Would recommend to everyone!</span>
      \"\"\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>occupation</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"17 characters\">?tudiante ? Perth</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>country</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"9 characters\">Australie</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>promo</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4 characters\">2017</span>\"
  </samp>]
  <span class=sf-dump-index>7</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:8</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>8</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>firstname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3 characters\">Kat</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>lastname</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>picture</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"25 characters\">/images/testimonies/8.png</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>deposit</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"342 characters\">The most wonderful experience, and a great first solo trip to Europe. The organisers are incredible, all the activities were amazing and kept us so busy!! Classes suited my level perfectly and I learned a lot, but most of all the people I met were wonderful and I&#039;ve forged friendships that will last a life time. Couldn&#039;t recommend it more!!</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>occupation</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"18 characters\">?tudiante ? Sydney</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>country</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"9 characters\">Australie</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>promo</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4 characters\">2015</span>\"
  </samp>]
  <span class=sf-dump-index>8</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:8</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>9</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>firstname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4 characters\">Lori</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>lastname</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>picture</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"25 characters\">/images/testimonies/9.png</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>deposit</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">One of the smartest things I have ever done - to take this course - it was a life changing experience - these people work so hard to make it a great and rich and diverse program -it was years of education smashed into weeks ! ! (2016) &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">I went to Nancy alone two years ago, I was terrified to be there alone but soon enough I made friends from all over the world. The managers and teachers of the courses were so incredibly endearing and kind and fantastic teachers. I think the secret of this program has not gotten out because if it had, you would have to get in line to get in. I am now taking 6 students there this summer and I cannot wait to watch them drink in this experience. Nancy is a warm and beautiful town--the people are so friendly and inviting.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">&lt;br&gt;I cannot wait to see them again. (2018)</span>
      \"\"\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>occupation</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"29 characters\">professeure ? Kerrville-Texas</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>country</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"3 characters\">USA</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>promo</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"9 characters\">2016,2018</span>\"
  </samp>]
  <span class=sf-dump-index>9</span> => <span class=sf-dump-note>array:8</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>id</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-num>10</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>firstname</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"4 characters\">Rian</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>lastname</span>\" => <span class=sf-dump-const>null</span>
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>picture</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"26 characters\">/images/testimonies/10.png</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>deposit</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"103 characters\">We got experiences, we got friends, we got all the stories to share... Happy to be part of the teams...</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>occupation</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"43 characters\">partenaire Allons-y Adventure Team, Jakarta</span>\"
